    "title": "SPATIO-TEMPORAL TRENDS OF HYDRO-CLIMATIC VARIABLES AND POTENTIAL WATER DEFICIT IN THE BAGEL ZUNGUR WATERSHED, NORTH-CENTRAL NIGERIA (1981\u20132020)",
